  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r ett avrop fr&#xe5;n Sidas ramavtal med Charles Kendall f&#xf6;r konsulttj&#xe4;nster inom upphandling (Reg. No. 14/001228) f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d vid upphandling till insatsen Andra fasen av polissamarbete i Albanien (2nd phase of Community policing cooperation in Albania). Insatsen uppg&#xe5;r maximalt till 228 300 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This cntribution is a call off contract from Sida&apos;s Framework Agreement with Charles Kendall for procurement consultant services (Reg. No. 14/001228) for support to tender the implementing consultant of the 2nd phase of  Community policing cooperation in Albania. The contribution amounts to maximum 228 300 SEK.</narrative>
